WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:02,700
I just looked at the big duck and the second duck

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,700
I haven't seen any good clothes yet

3
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,500
Chuhai happened to make a little fortune today

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,100
I just wanted to buy something for the whole family

5
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,500
Let everyone be happy and get rich.

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,300
If I talk to you for a while, you can't

7
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,500
Because the money spent is killing me

8
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,500
You say it first

9
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:15,500
As for whether to fight or not to fight?

10
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,700
Depends on my mood

11
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,740
Mother Yaqin

12
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,740
Slowly Satsuki

13
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:22,340
I encountered prawns in the sea for the first time today

14
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:25,540
And it’s a group of prawns, what kind of prawns?

15
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,540
That thing costs at least five yuan a pound

16
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:29,140
It is said that they are all exported abroad.

17
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,340
Food for foreigners

18
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,740
Guess what

19
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,540
How many pounds of prawns did I get?

20
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,920
It must be at least twenty pounds

21
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,320
Twenty pounds, one hundred yuan

22
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,720
Spend fifty yuan

23
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:43,720
I can barely guess without getting beaten.

24
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,720
Be brave

25
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:45,720
Guess the bigger picture

26
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:47,790
fifty pounds

27
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:49,840
Still not brave enough

28
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,350
Is it a hundred pounds?

29
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,100
Look at you like this

30
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,500
It can't be a thousand pounds, right?

31
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,700
You can really pull it off

32
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,900
One thousand catties

33
00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:01,700
This is the maximum carrying capacity of my boat.

34
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:02,700
There really have to be so many

35
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,100
I can also buy you these rags

36
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,920
Then you should say it

37
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,920
How much is it

38
00:01:10,570 --> 00:01:12,170
I gained over three hundred pounds today

39
00:01:12,170 --> 00:01:13,970
And I plan to go again at midnight today

40
00:01:13,970 --> 00:01:15,370
I should be able to get a few hundred more pounds.

41
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:18,620
More than a hundred kilograms

42
00:01:18,620 --> 00:01:20,620
Isn’t that just over a thousand yuan?

43
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:22,820
Prince Rong bless your mother

44
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:23,820
Earned more than a thousand yuan

45
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:27,020
I spent sixty-eight to buy some things for my family. Isn't that excessive?

46
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:28,020
Not excessive

47
00:01:28,550 --> 00:01:31,350
My son is really powerful

48
00:01:31,350 --> 00:01:32,350
Today's severe beating

49
00:01:32,350 --> 00:01:33,350
I probably won’t have to suffer anymore.
